  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 4546,
      "text": "Those who disbelieve and prevent others from Allah’s way, He will render their deeds void.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 47,
        "name": "سُورَةُ مُحَمَّدٍ",
        "englishName": "Muhammad",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Muhammad",
        "numberOfAyahs": 38,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 1,
      "juz": 26,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 507,
      "ruku": 442,
      "hizbQuarter": 202,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4547,
      "text": "As for those who believe, do righteous deeds, and believe in what has been sent down to Muhammad – which is the truth from their Lord – He will absolve them of their sins and set their condition right.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 47,
        "name": "سُورَةُ مُحَمَّدٍ",
        "englishName": "Muhammad",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Muhammad",
        "numberOfAyahs": 38,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 2,
      "juz": 26,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 507,
      "ruku": 442,
      "hizbQuarter": 202,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4548,
      "text": "That is because the disbelievers follow falsehood, whereas the believers follow the truth from their Lord. This is how Allah explains to people their comparisons[1].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 47,
        "name": "سُورَةُ مُحَمَّدٍ",
        "englishName": "Muhammad",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Muhammad",
        "numberOfAyahs": 38,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 3,
      "juz": 26,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 507,
      "ruku": 442,
      "hizbQuarter": 202,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4549,
      "text": "When you encounter the disbelievers [in battle], strike [their] necks until you have thoroughly subdued them, then bind the captives firmly[2]. Later [you may free them] as a favor[3] or for ransom until the war comes to an end[4]. That [is Our command], if Allah had willed, He could have subjected them to punishment, but [He ordered you to fight] to test some of you by means of others. Those who are killed in the way of Allah, He will never render their deeds void.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 47,
        "name": "سُورَةُ مُحَمَّدٍ",
        "englishName": "Muhammad",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Muhammad",
        "numberOfAyahs": 38,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 4,
      "juz": 26,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 507,
      "ruku": 442,
      "hizbQuarter": 202,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4550,
      "text": "He will guide them, and will set their condition right,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 47,
        "name": "سُورَةُ مُحَمَّدٍ",
        "englishName": "Muhammad",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Muhammad",
        "numberOfAyahs": 38,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 5,
      "juz": 26,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 507,
      "ruku": 442,
      "hizbQuarter": 202,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4551,
      "text": "and He will admit them to Paradise, which He has already made known to them[5].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 47,
        "name": "سُورَةُ مُحَمَّدٍ",
        "englishName": "Muhammad",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Muhammad",
        "numberOfAyahs": 38,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 6,
      "juz": 26,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 507,
      "ruku": 442,
      "hizbQuarter": 202,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4552,
      "text": "O you who believe, if you stand up for Allah, He will help you and make your steps firm[6].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 47,
        "name": "سُورَةُ مُحَمَّدٍ",
        "englishName": "Muhammad",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Muhammad",
        "numberOfAyahs": 38,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 7,
      "juz": 26,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 507,
      "ruku": 442,
      "hizbQuarter": 202,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4553,
      "text": "As for those who disbelieve, how wretched will be their state! And He will render their deeds void.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 47,
        "name": "سُورَةُ مُحَمَّدٍ",
        "englishName": "Muhammad",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Muhammad",
        "numberOfAyahs": 38,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 8,
      "juz": 26,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 507,
      "ruku": 442,
      "hizbQuarter": 202,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4554,
      "text": "That is because they detest what Allah has sent down, so He rendered their deeds worthless.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 47,
        "name": "سُورَةُ مُحَمَّدٍ",
        "englishName": "Muhammad",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Muhammad",
        "numberOfAyahs": 38,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 9,
      "juz": 26,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 507,
      "ruku": 442,
      "hizbQuarter": 202,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4555,
      "text": "Have they not traveled through the land to see what was the end of those before them? Allah destroyed them utterly[7], and a similar end awaits the disbelievers.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 47,
        "name": "سُورَةُ مُحَمَّدٍ",
        "englishName": "Muhammad",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Muhammad",
        "numberOfAyahs": 38,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 10,
      "juz": 26,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 507,
      "ruku": 442,
      "hizbQuarter": 203,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4556,
      "text": "That is because Allah is the Protector of the believers whereas the disbelievers have no protector.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 47,
        "name": "سُورَةُ مُحَمَّدٍ",
